<title>CANADA: Canada July petroleum product sales rise 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada July petroleum product sales rise 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada figures for sales of refined petroleum products:</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCT SALES (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>				   July 1996    July 1995	 pct</p>
<p>   Total sales		  7,528.2	7,097.5	  6.1</p>
<p>   Motor gasoline	     3,172.5	3,123.7	  1.6</p>
<p>   Diesel fuel		  1,740.0	1,616.0	  7.7</p>
<p>   Light fuel oil		 155.0	  141.6	  9.5</p>
<p>   Heavy fuel oil		 456.1	  401.0	 13.7</p>
<p>   Aviation turbo fuels	 535.4	  480.6	 11.4</p>
<p>   Petrochemical feedstocks   404.3	  372.1	  8.7</p>
<p>   All other products	 1,064.9	  962.5	 10.6</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745</p>
</text>
